  "note": "The book uses (A.18) only for (A.32), |η₊′|₂ ≤ 10.845789, which is an input to Prop 9.4.2. Erratum: The book says |(t+i)Mh(it)|_1 is at most twice a bracket but prints the bracket itself, 27.8622803; the argument gives only 55.7245604, and the true norm is 36.6773, so (A.18) is false (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_a_18.py`)."
